      "uid": "zhcn:5872b13d1679540ec7b0ebd6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从高尚那里收到了贝壳哦。\n它就像赠予者一样，奏响着\n温柔的海浪声……呵呵，感觉能睡个好觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c60b2e0c3a14426b6dd1d3f3c3a7246f1dbb7d07aaa9f2c6b079f594eff2b4c6",
