      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "周末计划去度假胜地视察呢。\n……如果可以的话，愿意陪我一起去吗？\n毕竟你的意见总是能直击本质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0a9bd92f3f99f74ea36bfcbe0fdab1510324687f0feb8f1b9dbdc004e02583",
